@font-face { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono'; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; src: url('https://all.haus/fonts/ibm-plex-mono-latin-400.woff2') format('woff2'); }
</style>
<div style="background: #f0efeb; padding: 32px 16px;">
<div style="max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto;">
<div style="margin: 0 0 20px; font-family: Jost, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.01em; line-height: 28px; color: #111111;"><a href="https://all.haus" style="color: #111111; text-decoration: none;"><img src="https://all.haus/brand/allhaus-disc-on-bone-1024.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 10px; border: 0;" /><span style="vertical-align: middle;">all.haus</span></a></div>
<div style="background: #ffffff; padding: 32px 28px;">
<h2 style="font-family: Literata, Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.2; color: #111111; margin: 0 0 20px;">Confirm your new address</h2>
<p style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: #5f5e5a; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 16px;">Someone (we hope you) has asked to change your registered email address on all.haus. Confirm to make this the address you log in with and where we write to you.</p>
<p style="margin: 8px 0 24px;"><a href="https://all.haus/auth/verify?emailChange=SAMPLE" style="display: inline-block; background: #111111; color: #ffffff; font-family: Jost, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; padding: 12px 32px; border-radius: 0; text-decoration: none;">Confirm address</a></p>
<p style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: #8a8880; line-height: 1.6; margin: 24px 0 0;">If it wasn&#39;t you, ignore this. Nothing changes unless the link is used.</p>
</div>
<p style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #8a8880; margin: 20px 0 0;">all.haus: together we can make it</p>
</div>
</div>",
  "subject": "Confirm your new address — all.haus",
  "textBody": "Confirm your new address

Someone (we hope you) has asked to change your registered email address on all.haus. Confirm to make this the address you log in with and where we write to you.

Confirm address: https://all.haus/auth/verify?emailChange=SAMPLE

If it wasn't you, ignore this. Nothing changes unless the link is used.

—
all.haus: together we can make it",
}
`;

exports[`the email catalogue > renders email-changed-notice 1`] = `
{
  "htmlBody": "<style>
@font-face { font-family: 'Jost'; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400 600; src: url('https://all.haus/fonts/jost-latin.woff2') format('woff2'); }
@font-face { font-family: 'Literata'; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300 700; src: url('https://all.haus/fonts/literata-latin-400.woff2') format('woff2'); }
@font-face { font-family: 'Literata'; font-style: italic; font-weight: 300 700; src: url('https://all.haus/fonts/literata-latin-400-italic.woff2') format('woff2'); }
@font-face { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono'; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; src: url('https://all.haus/fonts/ibm-plex-mono-latin-400.woff2') format('woff2'); }
</style>
<div style="background: #f0efeb; padding: 32px 16px;">
<div style="max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto;">
<div style="margin: 0 0 20px; font-family: Jost, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.01em; line-height: 28px; color: #111111;"><a href="https://all.haus" style="color: #111111; text-decoration: none;"><img src="https://all.haus/brand/allhaus-disc-on-bone-1024.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 10px; border: 0;" /><span style="vertical-align: middle;">all.haus</span></a></div>
<div style="background: #ffffff; padding: 32px 28px;">
<h2 style="font-family: Literata, Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.2; color: #111111; margin: 0 0 20px;">Your email address was changed</h2>
<p style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: #5f5e5a; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 16px;">On <strong style="color: #111111; font-weight: 600;">2026-10-02 14:05 UTC</strong> the address you log in with was changed from this one to r***@example.com. Every other device was logged out at the same time. If that was you, there&#39;s nothing more to do.</p>
<p style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: #5f5e5a; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 16px;">If it wasn&#39;t, press the button. It puts this address back and logs out every device, including whoever made the change. It works once, for the next 7 days, and for as long as it works nobody can export your account.</p>
<p style="margin: 8px 0 24px;"><a href="https://all.haus/auth/undo-email-change?change=SAMPLE&amp;token=SAMPLE" style="display: inline-block; background: #111111; color: #ffffff; font-family: Jost, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; padding: 12px 32px; border-radius: 0; text-decoration: none;">Undo the change</a></p>
<p style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: #5f5e5a; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 16px;">Then log in again with this address, and write to <a href="mailto:support@all.haus" style="color: #111111; text-decoration: underline;">support@all.haus</a> so we can look at what else was done.</p>
</div>
<p style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #8a8880; margin: 20px 0 0;">all.haus: together we can make it</p>
</div>
</div>",
  "subject": "Your all.haus email address was changed",
  "textBody": "Your email address was changed

On 2026-10-02 14:05 UTC the address you log in with was changed from this one to r***@example.com. Every other device was logged out at the same time. If that was you, there's nothing more to do.

If it wasn't, press the button. It puts this address back and logs out every device, including whoever made the change. It works once, for the next 7 days, and for as long as it works nobody can export your account.

Undo the change: https://all.haus/auth/undo-email-change?change=SAMPLE&token=SAMPLE

Then log in again with this address, and write to support@all.haus so we can look at what else was done.

—
all.haus: together we can make it",
}
`;

