<div style="margin: 0 0 20px; font-family: Jost, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.01em; line-height: 28px; color: #111111;"><a href="https://all.haus" style="color: #111111; text-decoration: none;"><img src="https://all.haus/brand/allhaus-disc-on-bone-1024.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 10px; border: 0;" /><span style="vertical-align: middle;">all.haus</span></a></div>
<div style="background: #ffffff; padding: 32px 28px;">
<h2 style="font-family: Literata, Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.2; color: #111111; margin: 0 0 20px;">Your account has been exported</h2>
<p style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: #5f5e5a; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 16px;">Your account export, Nostr secret key and all, was downloaded on <strong style="color: #111111; font-weight: 600;">2026-09-27 14:05 UTC</strong>. If that was you, the file is yours and there&#39;s nothing more to do.</p>
<p style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: #5f5e5a; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 16px;">If it wasn&#39;t, somebody else now holds your identity, and that key can&#39;t be swapped for a new one. Write to us at once at <a href="mailto:support@all.haus" style="color: #111111; text-decoration: underline;">support@all.haus</a>.</p>
</div>
<p style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #8a8880; margin: 20px 0 0;">all.haus: together we can make it</p>
</div>
</div>",
  "subject": "Your all.haus account was exported",
  "textBody": "Your account has been exported

Your account export, Nostr secret key and all, was downloaded on 2026-09-27 14:05 UTC. If that was you, the file is yours and there's nothing more to do.

If it wasn't, somebody else now holds your identity, and that key can't be swapped for a new one. Write to us at once at support@all.haus.

—
all.haus: together we can make it",
}
`;

