</style>
<div style="background: #f0efeb; padding: 32px 16px;">
<div style="max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto;">
<div style="margin: 0 0 20px; font-family: Jost, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.01em; line-height: 28px; color: #111111;"><a href="https://all.haus" style="color: #111111; text-decoration: none;"><img src="https://all.haus/brand/allhaus-disc-on-bone-1024.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 10px; border: 0;" /><span style="vertical-align: middle;">all.haus</span></a></div>
<div style="background: #ffffff; padding: 32px 28px;">
<h2 style="font-family: Literata, Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.2; color: #111111; margin: 0 0 20px;">Confirm your export</h2>
<p style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: #5f5e5a; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 16px;">Someone has asked to export your all.haus account, Nostr secret key included. That key isn&#39;t a password to your identity so much as the identity itself, so we&#39;d like to be sure it was you.</p>
<p style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: #5f5e5a; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 16px;">The link works once, for the next 15 minutes.</p>
<p style="margin: 8px 0 24px;"><a href="https://all.haus/account/export?token=SAMPLE" style="display: inline-block; background: #111111; color: #ffffff; font-family: Jost, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; padding: 12px 32px; border-radius: 0; text-decoration: none;">Confirm the export</a></p>
<p style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: #5f5e5a; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 16px;">If it wasn&#39;t you, don&#39;t press the link, and nothing will leave us. Then log out of all.haus, which logs you out on every device, and write to <a href="mailto:support@all.haus" style="color: #111111; text-decoration: underline;">support@all.haus</a>.</p>
</div>
<p style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #8a8880; margin: 20px 0 0;">all.haus: together we can make it</p>
</div>
</div>",
  "subject": "Confirm your all.haus account export",
  "textBody": "Confirm your export

Someone has asked to export your all.haus account, Nostr secret key included. That key isn't a password to your identity so much as the identity itself, so we'd like to be sure it was you.

The link works once, for the next 15 minutes.

Confirm the export: https://all.haus/account/export?token=SAMPLE

If it wasn't you, don't press the link, and nothing will leave us. Then log out of all.haus, which logs you out on every device, and write to support@all.haus.

—
all.haus: together we can make it",
}
`;

