<p style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: #5f5e5a; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 16px;">We charged your card <strong style="color: #111111; font-weight: 600;">£8.00</strong> on 20 September 2026. This covered:</p>
<table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 0 0 16px;"><tr><td style="font-family: Jost, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: #111111; padding: 6px 12px 6px 0; vertical-align: top;">The Edwardians<div style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #8a8880;">Vita Sackville-West</div></td><td style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 14px; color: #111111; padding: 6px 0; text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; vertical-align: top;">£3.00</td></tr><tr><td style="font-family: Jost, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: #111111; padding: 6px 12px 6px 0; vertical-align: top;">A Room of One&#39;s Own<div style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #8a8880;">Virginia Woolf</div></td><td style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 14px; color: #111111; padding: 6px 0; text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; vertical-align: top;">£0.00<div style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #8a8880;">covered by your free allowance</div></td></tr><tr><td style="font-family: Jost, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: #111111; padding: 6px 12px 6px 0; vertical-align: top;">Subscription — September<div style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #8a8880;">Virginia Woolf</div></td><td style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 14px; color: #111111; padding: 6px 0; text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; vertical-align: top;">£5.00</td></tr></table>
