  "subject": "Your all.haus receipt — £13.00",
  "textBody": "Your receipt

We charged your card £13.00 on 20 September 2026. This covered:

  The Edwardians — Vita Sackville-West — £3.00
  A Room of One's Own — Virginia Woolf — £0.00 (covered by your free allowance)
  Subscription — September — Virginia Woolf — £5.00

£5.00 of this charge is balance carried on your tab from earlier activity — a charge restored after a reversal, or a credit that was released back to your tab — rather than the reading and subscriptions listed above.

Paying us settles what you owed each Writer in full. We collect it on their behalf, and once a charge has gone through, that debt is discharged.

See it online: https://all.haus/reader?overlay=ledger

Something wrong with this charge? Write to support@all.haus.

—
all.haus: together we can make it",
}
`;

