</style>
<div style="background: #f0efeb; padding: 32px 16px;">
<div style="max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto;">
<div style="margin: 0 0 20px; font-family: Jost, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.01em; line-height: 28px; color: #111111;"><a href="https://all.haus" style="color: #111111; text-decoration: none;"><img src="https://all.haus/brand/allhaus-disc-on-bone-1024.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 10px; border: 0;" /><span style="vertical-align: middle;">all.haus</span></a></div>
<div style="background: #ffffff; padding: 32px 28px;">
<h2 style="font-family: Literata, Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.2; color: #111111; margin: 0 0 20px;">Your payouts are stuck</h2>
<p style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: #5f5e5a; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 16px;">Vita,</p>
<p style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: #5f5e5a; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 16px;">Payouts go through Stripe, and your Stripe account isn&#39;t in a state we can transfer to — usually because onboarding was never finished, or because Stripe has restricted it.</p>
<p style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: #5f5e5a; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 16px;">Your earnings are safe, and still yours. We hold them until we can pay you, and not a moment longer.</p>
<p style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: #5f5e5a; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 16px;">If nothing changes, in <strong style="color: #111111; font-weight: 600;">30 days</strong> we will stop offering paid access to your writing. Nothing is deleted: your work stays published and yours, and goes back on sale the day your Stripe account can receive a transfer.</p>
<p style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: #5f5e5a; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 16px;">Sort it out at <a href="https://all.haus/account" style="color: #111111; text-decoration: underline;">https://all.haus/account</a>, or write to <a href="mailto:support@all.haus" style="color: #111111; text-decoration: underline;">support@all.haus</a> if Stripe won&#39;t budge.</p>
</div>
<p style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #8a8880; margin: 20px 0 0;">all.haus: together we can make it</p>
</div>
</div>",
  "subject": "We haven't been able to pay you",
  "textBody": "Your payouts are stuck

Vita,

Payouts go through Stripe, and your Stripe account isn't in a state we can transfer to — usually because onboarding was never finished, or because Stripe has restricted it.

Your earnings are safe, and still yours. We hold them until we can pay you, and not a moment longer.

If nothing changes, in 30 days we will stop offering paid access to your writing. Nothing is deleted: your work stays published and yours, and goes back on sale the day your Stripe account can receive a transfer.

Sort it out at https://all.haus/account, or write to support@all.haus if Stripe won't budge.

—
all.haus: together we can make it",
}
`;

