@font-face { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono'; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; src: url('https://all.haus/fonts/ibm-plex-mono-latin-400.woff2') format('woff2'); }
</style>
<div style="background: #f0efeb; padding: 32px 16px;">
<div style="max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto;">
<div style="margin: 0 0 20px; font-family: Jost, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.01em; line-height: 28px; color: #111111;"><a href="https://all.haus" style="color: #111111; text-decoration: none;"><img src="https://all.haus/brand/allhaus-disc-on-bone-1024.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 10px; border: 0;" /><span style="vertical-align: middle;">all.haus</span></a></div>
<div style="background: #ffffff; padding: 32px 28px;">
<h2 style="font-family: Literata, Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.2; color: #111111; margin: 0 0 20px;">Your account is ready</h2>
<p style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: #5f5e5a; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 16px;">You asked us to say when we were ready for you. We are, and your account is waiting.</p>
<p style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: #5f5e5a; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 16px;">Log in with this address (<strong style="color: #111111; font-weight: 600;">reader@example.com</strong>) and we&#39;ll email you a link to get in. No password to remember, or to forget.</p>
<p style="margin: 8px 0 24px;"><a href="https://all.haus/auth" style="display: inline-block; background: #111111; color: #ffffff; font-family: Jost, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; padding: 12px 32px; border-radius: 0; text-decoration: none;">Log in</a></p>
<p style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: #5f5e5a; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 16px;">all.haus gathers the open social web (Bluesky, Mastodon, Substack, RSS and more) into channels that run on rules you set, rather than rules set on you. Make as many as you like.</p>
<p style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: #8a8880; line-height: 1.6; margin: 24px 0 0;">We&#39;re still small and still fixing things. If something&#39;s broken, please reply to this email. It reaches a person, not a queue.</p>
</div>
<p style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #8a8880; margin: 20px 0 0;">all.haus: together we can make it</p>
</div>
</div>",
  "subject": "We're ready for you on all.haus",
  "textBody": "Your account is ready

You asked us to say when we were ready for you. We are, and your account is waiting.

Log in with this address (reader@example.com) and we'll email you a link to get in. No password to remember, or to forget.

Log in: https://all.haus/auth

all.haus gathers the open social web (Bluesky, Mastodon, Substack, RSS and more) into channels that run on rules you set, rather than rules set on you. Make as many as you like.

We're still small and still fixing things. If something's broken, please reply to this email. It reaches a person, not a queue.

—
all.haus: together we can make it",
}
`;

